.el .ds Aq '
.TH fujicli-simulation-set 1  "set "
.SH NAME
fujicli\-simulation\-set \- Set simulation parameters
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBfujicli simulation set\fR [\fB\-\-clarity\fR] [\fB\-\-color\fR] [\fB\-\-color\-chrome\-effect\fR] [\fB\-\-color\-chrome\-fx\-blue\fR] [\fB\-\-color\-space\fR] [\fB\-\-custom\-setting\-name\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR]... [\fB\-\-dynamic\-range\fR] [\fB\-\-dynamic\-range\-priority\fR] [\fB\-\-film\-simulation\fR] [\fB\-\-grain\-effect\fR] [\fB\-\-highlight\-tone\fR] [\fB\-\-image\-quality\fR] [\fB\-\-image\-size\fR] [\fB\-\-lens\-modulation\-optimizer\fR] [\fB\-\-monochromatic\-color\-temperature\fR] [\fB\-\-monochromatic\-color\-tint\fR] [\fB\-\-noise\-reduction\fR] [\fB\-\-shadow\-tone\fR] [\fB\-\-sharpness\fR] [\fB\-\-smooth\-skin\-effect\fR] [\fB\-\-white\-balance\fR] [\fB\-\-white\-balance\-shift\-blue\fR] [\fB\-\-white\-balance\-shift\-red\fR] [\fB\-\-white\-balance\-temperature\fR] [\fB\-d\fR|\fB\-\-device\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fB\-\-target\-serial\-sha256\fR> <\fISLOT\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Set simulation parameters
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-clarity\fR \fI<CLARITY>\fR
Clarity

Schema range: \-5..=5. Step: 1. Camera firmware may further restrict values.
.TP
\fB\-\-color\fR \fI<COLOR>\fR
Color

Schema range: \-4..=4. Step: 1. Camera firmware may further restrict values.
.TP
\fB\-\-color\-chrome\-effect\fR \fI<COLOR_CHROME_EFFECT>\fR
Color Chrome Effect

Schema values: strong, weak, off. Camera firmware may further restrict values.
.TP
\fB\-\-color\-chrome\-fx\-blue\fR \fI<COLOR_CHROME_FX_BLUE>\fR
Color Chrome FX Blue

Schema values: strong, weak, off. Camera firmware may further restrict values.
.TP
\fB\-\-color\-space\fR \fI<COLOR_SPACE>\fR
Color Space

Schema values: srgb, adobe_rgb. Camera firmware may further restrict values.
.TP
\fB\-\-custom\-setting\-name\fR \fI<CUSTOM_SETTING_NAME>\fR
Custom Setting Name

Maximum length: 25 characters.
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Log extra debugging information (multiple instances increase verbosity)
.TP
\fB\-\-dynamic\-range\fR \fI<DYNAMIC_RANGE>\fR
Dynamic Range

Schema values: auto, hdr100, hdr200, hdr400, hdr800, hdr800_plus. Camera firmware may further restrict values.
.TP
\fB\-\-dynamic\-range\-priority\fR \fI<DYNAMIC_RANGE_PRIORITY>\fR
Dynamic Range Priority

Schema values: auto, plus, strong, weak, off. Camera firmware may further restrict values.
.TP
\fB\-\-film\-simulation\fR \fI<FILM_SIMULATION>\fR
Film Simulation

Schema values: provia, velvia, astia, pro_neg_hi, pro_neg_std, monochrome, monochrome_ye, monochrome_r, monochrome_g, sepia, classic_chrome, acros, acros_ye, acros_r, acros_g, eterna, classic_negative, eterna_bleach_bypass, nostalgic_negative, reala_ace. Camera firmware may further restrict values.
.TP
\fB\-\-grain\-effect\fR \fI<GRAIN_EFFECT>\fR
Grain Effect

Schema values: strong_large, weak_large, strong_small, weak_small, off. Camera firmware may further restrict values.
.TP
\fB\-\-highlight\-tone\fR \fI<HIGHLIGHT_TONE>\fR
Highlight Tone

Schema range: \-2..=4. Step: 0.5. Camera firmware may further restrict values.
.TP
\fB\-\-image\-quality\fR \fI<IMAGE_QUALITY>\fR
Image Quality

Schema values: fine_raw, fine, normal_raw, normal, raw. Camera firmware may further restrict values.
.TP
\fB\-\-image\-size\fR \fI<IMAGE_SIZE>\fR
Image Size

Schema values: 7728x5152, 7728x4344, 5152x5152, 6864x5152, 6432x5152, 5472x3648, 5472x3080, 3648x3648, 4864x3648, 4560x3648, 3888x2592, 3888x2184, 2592x2592, 3456x2592, 3264x2592. Camera firmware may further restrict values.
.TP
\fB\-\-lens\-modulation\-optimizer\fR \fI<LENS_MODULATION_OPTIMIZER>\fR
Lens Modulation Optimizer

Schema values: on, off. Camera firmware may further restrict values.
.TP
\fB\-\-monochromatic\-color\-temperature\fR \fI<MONOCHROMATIC_COLOR_TEMPERATURE>\fR
Monochromatic Color Temperature

Schema range: \-18..=18. Step: 1. Camera firmware may further restrict values.
.TP
\fB\-\-monochromatic\-color\-tint\fR \fI<MONOCHROMATIC_COLOR_TINT>\fR
Monochromatic Color Tint

Schema range: \-18..=18. Step: 1. Camera firmware may further restrict values.
.TP
\fB\-\-noise\-reduction\fR \fI<NOISE_REDUCTION>\fR
High ISO Noise Reduction

Schema values: \-4, \-3, \-2, \-1, 0, 1, 2, 3, 4. Camera firmware may further restrict values.
.TP
\fB\-\-shadow\-tone\fR \fI<SHADOW_TONE>\fR
Shadow Tone

Schema range: \-2..=4. Step: 0.5. Camera firmware may further restrict values.
.TP
\fB\-\-sharpness\fR \fI<SHARPNESS>\fR
Sharpness

Schema range: \-4..=4. Step: 1. Camera firmware may further restrict values.
.TP
\fB\-\-smooth\-skin\-effect\fR \fI<SMOOTH_SKIN_EFFECT>\fR
Smooth Skin Effect

Schema values: strong, weak, off. Camera firmware may further restrict values.
.TP
\fB\-\-white\-balance\fR \fI<WHITE_BALANCE>\fR
White Balance

Schema values: as_shot, white_priority, auto, ambience_priority, custom1, custom2, custom3, temperature, daylight, shade, fluorescent1, fluorescent2, fluorescent3, incandescent, underwater. Camera firmware may further restrict values.
.TP
\fB\-\-white\-balance\-shift\-blue\fR \fI<WHITE_BALANCE_SHIFT_BLUE>\fR
White Balance Shift Blue

Schema range: \-9..=9. Step: 1. Camera firmware may further restrict values.
.TP
\fB\-\-white\-balance\-shift\-red\fR \fI<WHITE_BALANCE_SHIFT_RED>\fR
White Balance Shift Red

Schema range: \-9..=9. Step: 1. Camera firmware may further restrict values.
.TP
\fB\-\-white\-balance\-temperature\fR \fI<WHITE_BALANCE_TEMPERATURE>\fR
White Balance Temperature

Schema range: 2500..=10000. Step: 10. Camera firmware may further restrict values.
.TP
\fB\-\-target\-serial\-sha256\fR \fI<TARGET_SERIAL_SHA256>\fR
SHA\-256 fingerprint of the exact physical camera serial number
.TP
\fB\-d\fR, \fB\-\-device\fR \fI<DEVICE>\fR
Manually specify target device using USB <BUS>.<ADDRESS>
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
<\fISLOT\fR>
Simulation slot number
